# بلوکی که با تأیید مالک در انتهای /opt/nikan/Caddyfile (Caddy سرور مشترک) است؛ روش در README.
# Caddy خود PartMachine فقط روی 172.17.0.1:18080 است. نام‌ها متن ثابت‌اند، چون Caddy سرور فقط متغیرهای خودش را دارد.

# PartMachine / Tarashino (/opt/partmachine, deploy/shared-host)
# tarashino.com is on ArvanCloud. Since 2026-10-30 Arvan reaches this server over HTTPS (origin protocol HTTPS in
# Arvan's panel; verified: Arvan's edges connect to 443 only), so passwords and drawings are encrypted on that hop
# too. The certificate is Let's Encrypt; Caddy answers HTTP-01 renewals on 443 as well, through Arvan's redirect.
# The global trusted_proxies (Arvan's ranges) make {client_ip} the visitor; header_up keeps it unforgeable.
# If Arvan's origin protocol is ever set back to HTTP, the redirect below loops: switch it back to HTTPS.
http://tarashino.com {
	redir https://tarashino.com{uri} 308
}

https://tarashino.com {
	header -Server
	reverse_proxy 172.17.0.1:18080 {
		header_up X-Forwarded-For {client_ip}
		header_up X-Forwarded-Proto https
	}
}

# www and the earlier sslip.io test name go to the main name (the site image is built for one name only).
http://www.tarashino.com, partmachine.84-32-10-40.sslip.io {
	redir https://tarashino.com{uri} 308
}
